{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me review each item.\n\nQ021: source \"which you do not understand: ...\" target \"即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解：...\" — source says \"which you do not understand\"; target says \"even if you understand this language, you cannot understand\". That's a contradiction — DIRECTION/CONDITION reversal. FINDING. Target span \"即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解\". Correction: \"你无法理解这种语言：\". Evidence \"which you do not understand\".\n\nQ022: source \"The staff will allow us to drain...\" target \"这根法杖将让我们得以...\" fine. Source context has \"The staff has allowed us...\" but source is \"will allow\". Target matches source. \"You cannot stop us now!\" target \"你现在已经无法阻止我们了！\" fine. Source_context differs but source is the item's source; translation matches source. No finding. Actually the source says \"will allow us\" and target \"将让我们得以\" — fine. No issue.\n\nQ023: source \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\" target \"一副狂乱的眼睛凝视着他\" — \"peer out\" means look out through the slot; target says 凝视着他 (stares at him). Also \"他\" — should be \"你\"? The speaker addresses the player: \"What do you want\". Eyes peer out at the player. Target \"凝视着他\" uses third person \"him\" but should be looking out / at you. Is this a defect? \"peer out\" = 看出来/向外窥视. Target \"凝视着他\" — direction/referent: eyes peer out (from inside), not staring at him specifically... Actually peering out through the slot toward the player implies looking at you. \"他\" vs implied \"你\" — in Chinese translation, using \"他\" for player viewpoint is odd. This is arguably SUBJECT/REFERENT issue: player character should be second person. The rest of the translation uses 你 (\"你想干什么\"). So \"凝视着他\" is inconsistent — eyes peer out, staring at him. Hmm. The source \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\" doesn't specify whom they look at, just \"peer out\" (向外看). Target adds \"凝视着他\" — the \"他\" contradicts second-person narration. I'd call FINDING REFERENT: correction \"*一副狂乱的眼睛向外窥视。*\" Evidence \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\". Verdict: FINDING seems reasonable since \"他\" is third person while game addresses player as 你.\n\nQ024: \"Aeryn, are you well?\" → \"艾琳，你还好么？\" Fine. No issue.\n\nQ025: source \"I have not been able to find all of the orbs of command in my travels; could you have some of your men search for me?\" target \"我没能找到所有的指令水晶球；请问你可以让你们的人来帮我寻找一下吗？\" — fine. \"orbs of command\" translated \"指令水晶球\" — addition of 水晶? \"orbs\" = 球体, adding 水晶 (crystal) is added info but plausible/compatible? Rule 3: 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷. Can visible evidence judge \"水晶\" wrong? Source just says \"orbs\". Can't judge wrong. Not a defect. No finding.\n\nQ026: \"Number of items to make\" → \"制作的物品数量\". Fine.\n\nQ027: source \"Excellent. Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared.\" Target: \"很好，几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了。\" Hmm — \"I'll have everything prepared\" future; target \"我肯定把一切都准备好了\" reads as already prepared? Ambiguous. Also \"which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago\" — \"那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方\" fine. \"return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically\" — \"请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率\" fine. The \"我肯定把一切都准备好了\" — could read \"I'll surely have everything prepared (by then)\". Chinese \"几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了\" — with 了 it implies completion; future perfect, acceptable. Marginal; I might flag UNCERTAIN on VALUE/TIMING? Actually \"Return in a few days\" — target \"几天后你回来\" fine. I'll say no finding, or UNCERTAIN. I think it's acceptable; skip.\n\nQ028: \"you are called to serve\" → \"你效力的时候到了\" fine-ish. \"The nearby unhallowed morass inhabitants are growing restless\" → \"附近不洁沼泽中的居民正在蠢蠢欲动\" fine. \"You must go there and find the source\" → \"你必须去那里，找到这一切的源头\" fine. No finding.\n\nQ029: \"Nothing but hatchlings so far\" → \"到目前为止从未遇上幼龙\" — \"nothing but hatchlings\" means only hatchlings (we've found nothing except hatchlings). Target says \"从未遇上幼龙\" = never encountered hatchlings — opposite! Wait: \"Nothing but hatchlings so far\" = only hatchlings so far. Target: \"从未遇上幼龙\" (never met hatchlings). That's a VALUE/DIRECTION reversal. FINDING. Target span \"到目前为止从未遇上幼龙\". Correction: \"到目前为止只遇到幼龙\". Evidence \"Nothing but hatchlings so far\".\n\nAlso \"she is something special in combat\" — \"她在战斗中确实不同凡响\" fine. \"wyrmic\" translated 龙战士 fine. \"Expedition Captain\" fine. \"Gorran is one of the finest rangers I know\" — \"高岚是我认识的最优秀的巡林客之一\" fine. No other findings.\n\nQ030: \"Report for bad behavior\" → \"举报我的不良行为\" — wait, this is a menu option to report another user's bad behavior. \"我的\" (my) is wrong — the report is about the other user. Source context: user menu for another player (citem.login), option \"Report for bad behavior\" ui=\"report\". Target adds \"我的\" making it report my own behavior. SUBJECT/REFERENT error. FINDING. Correction: \"举报不良行为\" or \"举报该用户的不良行为\". Evidence: \"Report for bad behavior\".\n\nQ031: \"Place the object where?\" → \"将物品丢弃到哪里？\" — source context shows options include inventory and drop; \"place\" ≠ only \"drop\". Target narrows to 丢弃 (drop). But wait — rule: if source_context exists, it's equally valid evidence. Context shows the dialog offers \"Inventory of %s\", \"Drop @\", \"NPC Inventory\". So \"丢弃\" is wrong — should be \"放置\". FINDING. Target span \"将物品丢弃到哪里\". Evidence \"Place the object where?\" Correction: \"将物品放到哪里？\".\n\nQ032: source \"Amassed 3000 gold pieces.\" target \"在\"龙之贪婪\"成就中积累3000金币。\" — the target adds \"在'龙之贪婪'成就中\" (in the Dragon's Greed achievement). Source context shows this desc belongs to \"Treasure Hoarder\" achievement (3000), while Dragon's Greed is 8000. So the addition is contradicted by source context — the achievement is Treasure Hoarder, not Dragon's Greed. FINDING (ADDITION/REFERENT). Target span \"在\"龙之贪婪\"成就中积累3000金币\" — actually span must appear verbatim: \"在\"龙之贪婪\"成就中积累3000金币。\" The quotes are Chinese full-width \"龙之贪婪\". In the target JSON: \"在“龙之贪婪”成就中积累3000金币。\" I must reproduce exactly. Evidence: source_context shows name = \"Treasure Hoarder\" with desc [[SOURCE_MATCH_1]] and can_gain 3000, while DRAGON_GREED desc is \"Amassed 8000 gold pieces.\" Evidence string must appear verbatim in source or source_context. Use \"name = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\"\" — appears in context. Correction: \"积累3000金币。\" Good.\n\nQ033: \"Became the new master of the arena in 30-wave mode.\" → \"在30波模式中成为新的竞技场主宰。\" Fine.\n\nQ034: \"I will not let you down!\" → \"我一定会让你失望的！\" — opposite meaning! FINDING. Correction: \"我不会让你失望的！\" Claim type DIRECTION (negation reversal) or VALUE. I'll use DIRECTION.\n\nQ035: \"Got to wave 50 in the arena.\" → \"竞技场生存至第20轮。\" — 50 vs 20. FINDING VALUE. Correction \"竞技场生存至第50轮。\" Evidence \"Got to wave 50 in the arena.\"\n\nQ036: \"Now, this is impressive!\" — this is an achievement NAME (LINANIIL_DEAD). Target \"这个发现可真是令人印象深刻！\" — adds \"这个发现\" (this discovery). Source doesn't mention discovery. Is that a defect? Achievement name as exclamation. \"Now, this is impressive!\" Target adds discovery — addition of info not in source. Can visible evidence judge it wrong? Source is just an exclamation; \"这个发现\" adds a specific referent. Hmm, achievement is for killing Linaniil... \"发现\" is not supported. But rule 3: new info compatible with visible evidence and can't be judged wrong by visible evidence doesn't constitute defect. Is \"这个发现\" judgeable as wrong? The source is an exclamation without referent; adding \"发现\" introduces an element not present. It's an ADDITION of a specific subject. I could report as FINDING ADDITION or UNCERTAIN. Given it's an achievement name, adding \"这个发现\" changes meaning somewhat. I'd say FINDING ADDITION: correction \"哇，这可真令人印象深刻！\" Evidence \"Now, this is impressive!\". Hmm, but is that objective? The source has no mention of discovery; the translation asserts \"this discovery\" — objectively an added noun. I'll go FINDING. Or UNCERTAIN to be safe. Achievement name for killing a boss — \"发现\" is unrelated; I'll say FINDING with claim ADDITION.\n\nQ037: \"Achieved your wild dreams of power and eternal life: you turned into a Lich!\" → \"成就你的野心并获得永恒的生命，你终于成为了巫妖！\" — \"wild dreams of power\" = 对力量的狂野梦想; target \"成就你的野心\" loses \"power\" but okay-ish. \"eternal life\" 永恒的生命 fine. Omission of \"力量\" — minor. \"wild\" dropped. Is that an objective defect? \"dreams of power and eternal life\" → \"野心\" covers power-ish ambition loosely. Marginal; I'd not report. Actually \"power\" omitted: OMISSION. Hmm. 野心 (ambition) partially captures \"dreams of power\". I think it's acceptable paraphrase. Skip.\n\nQ038: \"Kickin' it old-school\" → \"现代风格\" (modern style) — opposite! Old-school = 复古/老派. FINDING. Correction: \"复古怀旧\" / \"老派风格\". Claim DIRECTION or VALUE. Evidence \"Kickin' it old-school\". Target span \"现代风格\".\n\nQ039: \"Killed a boss while already dead.\" → \"在已死亡的状态下杀死一个BOSS。\" Fine. Context: p.dead — party leader dead while killing boss. Fine.\n\nQ040: \"Stabilized the Abashed Expanse to maintain it in orbit.\" → \"控制次元浮岛使其稳定在地面上。\" — \"maintain it in orbit\" = 保持其在轨道上; target \"稳定在地面上\" (stable on the ground) — contradicts orbit. FINDING. Correction: \"稳定'恍惚穹域'使其维持在轨道上。\" Achievement name \"Orbituary\" supports orbit. Evidence \"Stabilized the Abashed Expanse to maintain it in orbit.\" Target span \"使其稳定在地面上\". Claim VALUE/OTHER. Use VALUE? It's about location/state. STATE maybe. I'll use STATE.\n\nAlso Q040 \"Abashed Expanse\" translated \"次元浮岛\" — proper noun; zone name. Can't judge without knowledge? The name \"Abashed Expanse\" ≠ 次元浮岛 (dimensional floating island). But it's a proper noun translation choice; the context shows zone name \"Abashed Expanse\". 次元浮岛 doesn't correspond literally but is a localization choice for the zone. Can't definitively say wrong. Skip.\n\nQ022 check again: source \"will allow us\" target \"将让我们得以\" ok. Also \"summon Him through!\" target \"召唤他降临\" fine. No finding.\n\nQ027: also \"It opens the ruins of Telmur\" — \"它可以打开泰尔玛废墟\" fine. \"your odds of surviving our portal attempt\" — \"你通过传送门时存活的几率\" — \"our portal attempt\" = 我们尝试开启传送门; target \"你通过传送门时\" implies passing through. Slight shift but compatible. Skip. Actually \"我肯定把一切都准备好了\" vs \"I'll have everything prepared\" — future promise. The 了 + 肯定 reads like \"I'll surely have it all ready (by then)\". Acceptable. Skip.\n\nQ023 second thought: is \"凝视着他\" a FINDING? The narration in game is second person (\"What do you want, @playerdescriptor.race@?\"). The slot opens and eyes peer out — at the player. \"凝视着他\" introduces third-person \"him\" inconsistent with the second-person address. Also \"peer out\" (向外看/窥视) vs \"凝视\" (stare). Objective: \"他\" has no antecedent in second-person dialogue; the source's \"peer out\" doesn't specify object. I'll report FINDING REFERENT with correction \"*一副狂乱的眼睛向外窥视。*\". Evidence \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\".\n\nQ026 fine.\n\nQ029: also \"Expedition Captain\" — target \"探险队队长\" placed before name: \"探险队队长，科纳克人战士瑞丽\" fine. \"cornac fighter\" fine.\n\nQ028: \"you are called to serve\" — \"你效力的时候到了\" fine.\n\nNow assemble JSON with 20 items Q021–Q040 in order, observation field required for each.\n\nObservations: brief neutral description.\n\nQ021: FINDING, CONDITION (reversal) — actually type: \"which you do not understand\" → \"即使你懂得\" reverses condition. claim_type CONDITION. Correction: \"你无法理解这种语言：\".\n\nQ022: no candidates, observation.\n\nQ023: FINDING REFERENT.\n\nQ024: none.\n\nQ025: none.\n\nQ026: none.\n\nQ027: none.\n\nQ028: none.\n\nQ029: FINDING DIRECTION (or VALUE). \"Nothing but hatchlings\" = only hatchlings; target negates. I'll use DIRECTION.\n\nQ030: FINDING SUBJECT (target says \"my\" bad behavior). Claim SUBJECT.\n\nQ031: FINDING ACTION (place→drop only). Or SCOPE. I'll use ACTION.\n\nQ032: FINDING ADDITION (achievement name) — actually wrong referent: attributes to Dragon's Greed instead of Treasure Hoarder. REFERENT. Use REFERENT.\n\nQ033: none.\n\nQ034: FINDING DIRECTION.\n\nQ035: FINDING VALUE.\n\nQ036: FINDING ADDITION (or UNCERTAIN). I'll go FINDING ADDITION. Hmm, let me reconsider: \"Now, this is impressive!\" as achievement name for killing Linaniil. Target \"这个发现可真是令人印象深刻！\" — \"这个发现\" is an added subject. Objective enough. FINDING ADDITION, correction \"这可真是令人印象深刻！\".\n\nQ037: none.\n\nQ038: FINDING DIRECTION/VALUE — \"old-school\" → \"现代风格\" reversal. DIRECTION.\n\nQ039: none.\n\nQ040: FINDING STATE (in orbit vs on ground).\n\nFor Q032 evidence: must be verbatim from source_context. \"name = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\",\" appears. Also \"desc = _t[[Amassed 8000 gold pieces.]]\" appears. I'll use: \"name = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\"\" plus maybe \"desc = _t[[Amassed 8000 gold pieces.]]\" — evidence can be a single string; I'll include one: \"name = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\",\" — check verbatim in context: `\\tname = \"Treasure Hoarder\",` yes contains `name = \"Treasure Hoarder\",`. Good.\n\nFor Q021 evidence: \"which you do not understand:\" verbatim in source. Yes.\n\nFor Q031 evidence: \"Place the object where?\" verbatim in source. Yes. Could also cite \"Drop @\" from context. Use source text.\n\nFor Q040 evidence: \"Stabilized the Abashed Expanse to maintain it in orbit.\" verbatim. Yes.\n\nQ036 evidence: \"Now, this is impressive!\" verbatim.\n\nQ023 evidence: \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\" verbatim.\n\nQ029 evidence: \"Nothing but hatchlings so far\" verbatim.\n\nQ030 evidence: \"Report for bad behavior\" verbatim. Could add context that it's a menu for another user, but evidence must be verbatim string. Use source.\n\nQ034 evidence: \"I will not let you down!\" verbatim.\n\nQ035 evidence: \"Got to wave 50 in the arena.\" verbatim.\n\nQ038 evidence: \"Kickin' it old-school\" verbatim.\n\nTarget spans verbatim:\nQ021: \"即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解\"\nQ023: \"一副狂乱的眼睛凝视着他。\"\nQ029: \"到目前为止从未遇上幼龙\"\nQ030: \"举报我的不良行为\"\nQ031: \"将物品丢弃到哪里？\"\nQ032: \"在“龙之贪婪”成就中积累3000金币\"\nQ034: \"我一定会让你失望的！\"\nQ035: \"竞技场生存至第20轮\"\nQ036: \"这个发现可真是令人印象深刻！\"\nQ038: \"现代风格\"\nQ040: \"使其稳定在地面上\"\n\nOutput JSON only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q021\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解\",\n          \"correction\": \"你无法理解这种语言：\",\n          \"evidence\": \"which you do not understand:\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文说“你看不懂这段文字”，译文反转为“即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解”，条件关系颠倒。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q022\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"译文与 source 中的将来时态和语气一致，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q023\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"一副狂乱的眼睛凝视着他。\",\n          \"correction\": \"*一副狂乱的眼睛向外窥视。*\",\n          \"evidence\": \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文只说眼睛从门缝向外窥视，且该对话以第二人称称呼玩家（“你想干什么”），译文却使用“凝视着他”，指代对象与叙述视角不符。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q024\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"问候语的译文准确，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q025\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"译文与源文语义一致；“水晶”为可由上下文相容的补充，不构成缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q026\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"数量对话框标题的译文准确，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q027\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"译文的时态与语义与源文相容，未发现可判定的客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q028\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"任务指派文本的译文与源文语义一致，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q029\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"到目前为止从未遇上幼龙\",\n          \"correction\": \"到目前为止只遇到幼龙\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Nothing but hatchlings so far\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文“Nothing but hatchlings”意为“至今只遇到幼龙”，译文反转为“从未遇上幼龙”，语义完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q030\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"SUBJECT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"举报我的不良行为\",\n          \"correction\": \"举报不良行为\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Report for bad behavior\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source_context 显示该菜单项作用于其他用户（citem.login），选项是举报对方的不良行为，译文加入“我的”使主语错误。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q031\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ACTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"将物品丢弃到哪里？\",\n          \"correction\": \"将物品放置到哪里？\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Place the object where?\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source_context 显示后续选项包含放入背包、丢弃和 NPC 背包等多种放置方式，译文 narrowed 为“丢弃”，与“Place”的完整含义不符。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q032\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"在“龙之贪婪”成就中积累3000金币\",\n          \"correction\": \"积累3000金币。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"name = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\",\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source_context 显示 3000 金币的成就名为 Treasure Hoarder，而 Dragon's Greed（龙之贪婪）对应 8000 金币；译文错误地归入“龙之贪婪”成就。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q033\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"成就描述的译文与源文一致，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q034\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"我一定会让你失望的！\",\n          \"correction\": \"我不会让你失望的！\",\n          \"evidence\": \"I will not let you down!\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文为否定（不会让你失望），译文丢失否定并反转为“一定会让你失望”，语义相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q035\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"竞技场生存至第20轮\",\n          \"correction\": \"竞技场生存至第50轮\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Got to wave 50 in the arena.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文数值为 50 波，译文写成第 20 轮，数值错误。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q036\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"这个发现可真是令人印象深刻！\",\n          \"correction\": \"这可真是令人印象深刻！\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Now, this is impressive!\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文为不含特定宾语的感叹语，译文添加“这个发现”这一主语，源文中并无对应内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q037\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"成就描述的核心信息（野心、永恒生命、成为巫妖）均已保留，未发现可判定的客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q038\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"现代风格\",\n          \"correction\": \"老派怀旧风格\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Kickin' it old-school\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文“old-school”指老派、复古，译文“现代风格”含义相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q039\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"成就描述的译文与源文语义一致，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q040\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"STATE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"使其稳定在地面上\",\n          \"correction\": \"使其稳定维持在轨道上\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Stabilized the Abashed Expanse to maintain it in orbit.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文明确说维持其“在轨道上”（in orbit），译文写成“稳定在地面上”，状态位置相反。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":8920,"output":5631,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":3937,"totalTokens":14551,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984617225,"responseId":"202608291423375e0aa05529fd440f","rawStopReason":"stop"},"toolResults":[]}
{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"你是双语翻译审核员。逐条比较英文 source 与中文 target，判断是否存在客观、实质性的翻译缺陷。\n\n规则：\n\n1. 只报告可由本请求中可见文本直接支持的客观问题；不要依赖外部知识、仓库记忆、猜测或风格偏好。\n2. 若条目包含 source_context，可把它作为与 source 同等有效的源码证据；若没有，则只能使用 source 与 target。\n3. 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷。\n4. FINDING 表示证据足以确定存在缺陷；UNCERTAIN 仅用于证据指向问题但仍有真实歧义；没有可报告的客观问题时 candidates 为空数组。\n5. 一个条目可报告多个相互独立的候选。不要因为发现一个问题而停止检查，也不要让错误候选抵消正确候选。\n6. 每个候选的 target_span 必须逐字出现在 target 中；evidence 必须逐字出现在 source，或在该条目存在时逐字出现在 source_context 中。\n7. 保持输入顺序和 neutral_id 完全不变。严格输出符合给定 schema 的 JSON，不要输出 Markdown 或额外说明。\n\n缺陷类型：VALUE、DIRECTION、CONDITION、SUBJECT、REFERENT、TIMING、SCOPE、ACTION、STATE、ORDER、OMISSION、ADDITION、OTHER。\n\n输出 JSON Schema（逐字遵守）：\n{\n  \"$schema\": \"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\"items\"],\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"items\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"minItems\": 20,\n      \"maxItems\": 20,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"required\": [\"neutral_id\", \"candidates\", \"observation\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"neutral_id\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^Q[0-9]{3}$\"},\n          \"candidates\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"maxItems\": 4,\n            \"items\": {\n              \"type\": \"object\",\n              \"additionalProperties\": false,\n              \"required\": [\"verdict\", \"claim_type\", \"target_span\", \"correction\", \"evidence\"],\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"verdict\": {\"enum\": [\"FINDING\", \"UNCERTAIN\"]},\n                \"claim_type\": {\"enum\": [\"VALUE\", \"DIRECTION\", \"CONDITION\", \"SUBJECT\", \"REFERENT\", \"TIMING\", \"SCOPE\", \"ACTION\", \"STATE\", \"ORDER\", \"OMISSION\", \"ADDITION\", \"OTHER\"]},\n                \"target_span\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"correction\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1},\n                \"evidence\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"observation\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1}\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n输入 JSON：\n{\"schema_version\":\"source-context-controlled-confirmation-request-b-v2\",\"items\":[{\"neutral_id\":\"Q021\",\"source\":\"which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Sho ch'zun Eyal mor donuth, ik ranaheli donoth trun ze.'#{normal}#\",\"target\":\"即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解：#{italic}#'Sho ch'zun Eyal mor donuth, ik ranaheli donoth trun ze.'#{normal}#\",\"source_context\":\"-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n-- Sher'Tul\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-1\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"first mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore1.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[You see here a mural showing a dark and tortured world. Large, god-like figures with powerful auras fight each other, and the earth is torn beneath their feet.\\nThere is some text underneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]] or _t[[#{italic}#'In the beginning the world was dark, and the petty gods fought over their broken lands.'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"shertul-fortress-2\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"sher'tul\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"second mural painting\\\", always_pop = true,\\n\\timage = \\\"shertul_fortress_lore2.png\\\",\\n\\tlore = function() return _t[[In this picture a huge god with glowing eyes towers above the land, and in his right hand he holds high the sun. The other gods are running from him, wincing from the light.\\nThere is some text underneath ]]..(not game.player:attr(\\\"speaks_shertul\\\") and _t[[which you do not understand: #{italic}#'Fa AMAKTHEL tabak, ik koru bazan tro yu, ik ranaheli tobol don schek ruun. Ik blana dem Soli as banafel ik goriz uf Eyal ik blod, \\\"Tro fasa goru domus asam, ik goru domit tro Eyal.\\\"'#{normal}#]] or _t[[#{italic}#'But AMAKTHEL came, and his might surpassed all else, and the petty gods fled before his glory. And he made the Sun from his breath and held it above the world and said, \\\"All that this light touches shall be mine, and this light shall touch all the world.'#{normal}#]])\\n\\tend,\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q022\",\"source\":\"The Creator. The God who made this world, He who watched silently as the races fought and burnt the land.\\nHe who felt great sorrow for this world. He who shall now shatter the barriers of this world to remake it, only better!\\nThe staff will allow us to drain enough energy from this world to open the portal to the Void and summon Him through!\\nYou cannot stop us now!\",\"target\":\"造物主，创造这个世界的神。他默默注视着各个种族争战不休，将大地付之一炬。\\n他为这个世界深感悲痛。如今他将击碎这个世界的屏障，将它重塑得更加美好！\\n这根法杖将让我们得以从这个世界抽取足够的能量，打开通往虚空的传送门并召唤他降临！\\n你现在已经无法阻止我们了！\",\"source_context\":\"newChat{ id=\\\"explain3\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[The Creator. The God who made this world, He who watched silently as the races fought and burnt the land.\\nHe who felt great sorrow for this world. He who shall now shatter the barriers of this world to remake it, only better!\\nThe staff has allowed us to drain enough energy from this world to open the portal to the Void and summon Him through!\\nIt is already too late. He is coming through as we speak -- it is only a matter of hours!]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I *WILL* stop you! The world will not end today!\\\", jump=\\\"aeryn\\\", switch_npc={name=_t\\\"High Sun Paladin Aeryn\\\", image=\\\"npc/humanoid_human_high_sun_paladin_aeryn.png\\\"}, action=aeryn_comes, cond=aeryn_alive},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I *WILL* stop you! The world will not end today!\\\", cond=aeryn_dead},\\n\\t}\\n}\\nelse\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"explain3\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I *WILL* stop you! The world will not end today!\\\", jump=\\\"aeryn\\\", switch_npc={name=_t\\\"High Sun Paladin Aeryn\\\", image=\\\"npc/humanoid_human_high_sun_paladin_aeryn.png\\\"}, action=aeryn_comes, cond=aeryn_alive},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I *WILL* stop you! The world will not end today!\\\", cond=aeryn_dead},\\n\\t}\\n}\\nend\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"aeryn\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[#LIGHT_GREEN#*The air whirls at your side and suddenly High Sun Paladin Aeryn appears!*#WHITE#\\nThen you shall not fight alone! Together we shall stop them, or die trying!]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I am glad to have you at my side, my Lady. Let's hunt some wizards!\\\"},\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q023\",\"source\":\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*A slot in the door opens and a pair of wild eyes peer out.*#WHITE#\\nWhat do you want, @playerdescriptor.race@?\",\"target\":\"#LIGHT_GREEN#*门上开了一个小洞，一副狂乱的眼睛凝视着他。*#WHITE#\\n你想干什么，@playerdescriptor.race@？\",\"source_context\":\"\\nlocal function check_materials(npc, player)\\n\\tlocal gem_o, gem_item, gem_inven_id = player:findInAllInventories(\\\"Resonating Diamond\\\", {raw_name=true})\\n\\tlocal athame_o, athame_item, athame_inven_id = player:findInAllInventories(\\\"Blood-Runed Athame\\\", {raw_name=true})\\n\\treturn gem_o and athame_o and player.money >= 100\\nend\\n\\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\\n-- Main dialog\\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"welcome\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Paladin Aeryn told me that you could help me. I need to get to Maj'Eyal.\\\", jump=\\\"help\\\", cond=function(npc, player) return game.state:isAdvanced() and not player:hasQuest(\\\"west-portal\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I found the Blood-Runed Athame, but there was no Resonating Diamond.\\\", jump=\\\"athame\\\", cond=function(npc, player) return player:hasQuest(\\\"west-portal\\\") and player:hasQuest(\\\"west-portal\\\"):isCompleted(\\\"athame\\\") and not player:hasQuest(\\\"west-portal\\\"):isCompleted(\\\"gem\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I have a Resonating Diamond.\\\", jump=\\\"complete\\\", cond=function(npc, player) return player:hasQuest(\\\"west-portal\\\") and player:hasQuest(\\\"west-portal\\\"):isCompleted(\\\"gem\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t(\\\"Sorry, I have to go!\\\", \\\"chat_zemekkys\\\")},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\\n-- Give quest\\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"help\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q024\",\"source\":\"Aeryn, are you well?\",\"target\":\"艾琳，你还好么？\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\tend},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\n----------- If the void portal is still closed\\nelse\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"welcome\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[#LIGHT_GREEN#*The two Sorcerers lie dead before you.*#WHITE#\\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*Their bodies vanish in some immaterial mist.*#WHITE#\\nYou have won the game!\\nBoth Maj'Eyal and the Far East are safe from the dark schemes of the Sorcerers and their God.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", jump=\\\"aeryn-ok\\\", switch_npc=aeryn_alive(), cond=aeryn_alive},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[leave]\\\", action=function(npc, player) player:hasQuest(\\\"high-peak\\\"):win(\\\"full\\\") end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"aeryn-ok\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[I cannot believe we succeeded. I was prepared to die and yet I live.\\nI might have underestimated you. You did more than we could have hoped for!]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"We both did.\\\", action=function(npc, player) player:hasQuest(\\\"high-peak\\\"):win(\\\"full\\\") end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\nend\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q025\",\"source\":\"Thanks, my lady. I have not been able to find all of the orbs of command in my travels; could you have some of your men search for me?\",\"target\":\"谢谢，我的女士。我没能找到所有的指令水晶球；请问你可以让你们的人来帮我寻找一下吗？\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t{_t\\\"Maybe I'll visit him. Thank you.\\\", jump=\\\"welcome\\\"},\\n\\t},\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"prides-dead\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[The news has indeed reached me. I could scarce believe it, so long have we been at war with the Pride.\\nNow they are dead? At the hands of just one @playerdescriptor.race@? Truly I am amazed by your power.\\nWhile you were busy bringing an end to the orcs, we managed to discover some parts of the truth from a captive orc.\\nHe talked about the shield protecting the High Peak. It seems to be controlled by \\\"orbs of command\\\" which the masters of the Prides had in their possession.\\nHe also said the only way to enter the peak and de-activate the shield is through the \\\"slime tunnels\\\", located somewhere in one of the Prides, probably Grushnak.\\n]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\",\\n\\t\\tjump=\\\"prides-dead-orbs-missing\\\",\\n\\t\\tcond=function(npc, player) return not (game.party:findInAllPartyInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"ORB_DRAGON\\\") and game.party:findInAllPartyInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"ORB_DESTRUCTION\\\") and game.party:findInAllPartyInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"ORB_UNDEATH\\\") and game.party:findInAllPartyInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"ORB_ELEMENTS\\\")) end\\n\\t\\t},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Thanks, my lady. I will look for the tunnel and venture inside the Peak.\\\", \\n\\t\\tcond=function(npc, player) return (game.party:findInAllPartyInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"ORB_DRAGON\\\") and game.party:findInAllPartyInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"ORB_DESTRUCTION\\\") and game.party:findInAllPartyInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"ORB_UNDEATH\\\") and game.party:findInAllPartyInventoriesBy(\\\"define_as\\\", \\\"ORB_ELEMENTS\\\")) end,\\n\\t\\taction=function(npc, player)\\n\\t\\t\\tplayer:setQuestStatus(\\\"orc-pride\\\", engine.Quest.DONE)\\n\\t\\t\\tplayer:grantQuest(\\\"high-peak\\\")\\n\\t\\tend},\\n\\t},\\n}\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q026\",\"source\":\"Number of items to make\",\"target\":\"制作的物品数量\",\"source_context\":\"\\tif not item then return end\\n\\n\\tif item.action then\\n\\t\\titem:action()\\n\\telseif item.unique then\\n\\t\\tlocal n = not item.error and item.obj or game.zone:finishEntity(game.level, \\\"object\\\", item.e)\\n\\t\\tif n then\\n\\t\\t\\tn:identify(true)\\n\\t\\t\\tself:acceptObject(n)\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\telse\\n\\t\\tlocal example = item.obj and not item.error\\n\\t\\tgame:registerDialog(GetQuantity.new(_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", (\\\"Enter 1-100%s\\\"):tformat(example and _t\\\", or 0 for the example item\\\" or \\\"\\\"), 20, 100, function(qty)\\n\\t\\t\\tif qty == 0 and item.obj and not item.error then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tself:acceptObject(item.obj)\\n\\t\\t\\telse\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tgame.log(\\\"#LIGHT_BLUE# Creating %d items:\\\", qty)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tDialog:yesnoPopup(_t\\\"Ego\\\", _t\\\"Add an ego enhancement if possible?\\\", function(ret)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif not ret then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tfor i = 1, qty do\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal n = game.zone:finishEntity(game.level, \\\"object\\\", item.e, {ego_chance=-1000})\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tn:identify(true)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tgame.zone:addEntity(game.level, n, \\\"object\\\", self.actor.x, self.actor.y)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tgame.log(\\\"#LIGHT_BLUE#Created %s\\\", n:getName({do_color=true}))\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tend\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q027\",\"source\":\"Excellent. Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared. Oh, take this. #LIGHT_GREEN#*He hands you a key*#WHITE# It opens the ruins of Telmur, which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago. If you happen to find a text in the ruins entitled \\\"Inverted and Reverted Probabilistic Fields,\\\" return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically.\",\"target\":\"很好，几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了。哦，带上这个。#LIGHT_GREEN#*他交给你一把钥匙。*#WHITE#它可以打开泰尔玛废墟，那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方。要是你在废墟之中找到一份标题是《反转与复原概率场》的文献，请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率。\",\"source_context\":\"\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"withheld_orb\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[Very well. There is no hurry. But I will need to spend a number of days studying it before we can create your portal.]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I understand. I'll return with the Athame and Diamond.\\\", action=function(npc, player) player:hasQuest(\\\"east-portal\\\"):setStatus(engine.Quest.COMPLETED, \\\"gotoreknor\\\") end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\n---------------------------------------------------------------\\n-- back with materials\\n---------------------------------------------------------------\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"has_material_gave_orb\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Thank you, and farewell.\\\", action=function(npc, player) player:hasQuest(\\\"east-portal\\\"):open_telmur(player) end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"has_material_withheld_orb\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[Excellent. Are you yet willing to leave the Orb in my care for a time?]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I dare not let it out of my sight. I'm sorry.\\\", jump=\\\"no_orb_loan\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"Here it is. Guard it carefully. I must return to the Far East soon.\\\", jump=\\\"orb_loan\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q028\",\"source\":\"@playername@, you are called to serve. The nearby unhallowed morass inhabitants are growing restless.\\nYou must go there and find the source.\",\"target\":\"@playername@，你效力的时候到了。附近不洁沼泽中的居民正在蠢蠢欲动。\\n你必须去那里，找到这一切的源头。\",\"source_context\":\"-- This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful,\\n-- but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of\\n-- MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the\\n-- GNU General Public License for more details.\\n--\\n-- You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License\\n-- along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\\n--\\n-- Nicolas Casalini \\\"DarkGod\\\"\\n-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"welcome\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I will, Grand Keeper.\\\", action=function() game:changeLevel(1, \\\"unhallowed-morass\\\") end},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"I am sorry, but I cannot do that.\\\", action=function(npc, player) player:setQuestStatus(\\\"start-point-zero\\\", engine.Quest.FAILED) end},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\nreturn \\\"welcome\\\"\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q029\",\"source\":\"#{bold}#Relle, Cornac Fighter & Expedition Captain#{normal}#\\nNothing but hatchlings so far. Honestly, if this keeps up we won't have enough dragonhide to cover a dragon, let alone cover our losses. I've really spared no expense this time as well: Gorran is one of the finest rangers I know, and Sodelost... his prices are exorbitant, but then what else would you expect from those money-grubbing dwarven Thronesmen? I must admit I don't know much about Xann. The locals say there's no finer wyrmic in the area, and I admit she is something special in combat. Now, if only she could turn her draconic talents to FINDING some dragons!\",\"target\":\"#{bold}#探险队队长，科纳克人战士瑞丽#{normal}#\\n到目前为止从未遇上幼龙。老实说，照这样下去，我们得到的龙皮连一条龙都盖不住，更别说弥补损失了。这次我也确实不惜血本：高岚是我认识的最优秀的巡林客之一；至于苏达罗斯特……他的要价高得离谱，不过钢铁王座那群贪财的矮人还能是什么样？我得承认，自己并不了解希安。当地人说这一带没有比她更出色的龙战士，而她在战斗中确实不同凡响。现在只盼她能把操控龙族力量的本事用来找出几条龙！\",\"source_context\":\"--\\n-- Nicolas Casalini \\\"DarkGod\\\"\\n-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n-- The Daikara\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-1\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"daikara\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"expedition journal entry (daikara)\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-2\\\",\\n\\tcategory = \\\"daikara\\\",\\n\\tname = _t\\\"expedition journal entry (daikara)\\\",\\n\\tlore = _t[[#{bold}#Sodelost, Dwarf Rogue#{normal}#\\nCan't believe I agreed to this expedition. I suppose it's because I've known Relle for a while. We've crossed paths many times at Derth's trading post. I even gave her a special rate for my services. Sentimental fool! All it's got me is boots filled with snow and a light coinpurse. I still don't understand why these Kingdom types are so enamoured with drakeskin... makes superior armour they say. Pah! If you can't handle metal armour, what business do you have even wearing armour? Leather has about as much use as a halfling tied to a... noises up ahead, must stop writing.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewLore{\\n\\tid = \\\"daikara-note-3\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q030\",\"source\":\"Report for bad behavior\",\"target\":\"举报我的不良行为\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\t\\t\\tend\\n\\n\\t\\t\\tif citem and citem.login then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal data = profile.chat:getUserInfo(citem.login)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tif data then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal list = {\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Show infos\\\", ui=\\\"show\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Whisper\\\", ui=\\\"whisper\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Ignore\\\", ui=\\\"ignore\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"Open profile(in browser)\\\", ui=\\\"profile\\\"},\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t{name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", ui=\\\"report\\\"}\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t}\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif data.char_link then table.insert(list, 3, {name=_t\\\"Open charsheet(in browser)\\\", ui=\\\"charsheet\\\"}) end\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tDialog:listPopup((\\\"User: \\\"):tformat(citem.login), _t\\\"Action\\\", list, 300, 200, function(sel)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif not sel or not sel.ui then return end\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tif sel.ui == \\\"show\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal UserInfo = require \\\"engine.dialogs.UserInfo\\\"\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tgame:registerDialog(UserInfo.new(data))\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\telseif sel.ui == \\\"profile\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tutil.browserOpenUrl(data.profile, {is_external=true})\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\telseif sel.ui == \\\"charsheet\\\" then\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tutil.browserOpenUrl(data.char_link, {is_external=true})\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\telseif sel.ui == \\\"whisper\\\" then\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q031\",\"source\":\"Place the object where?\",\"target\":\"将物品丢弃到哪里？\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\tgame:registerDialog(self)\\n\\tend)\\n\\tcoroutine.resume(co)\\nend\\n\\n--- Create the object, either dropping it or adding it to the player or npc's inventory\\nfunction _M:acceptObject(obj, actor)\\n\\tif not obj then game.log(\\\"#LIGHT_BLUE#No object to create\\\")\\n\\telse\\n\\t\\tobj = obj:cloneFull()\\n\\t\\tactor = actor or self.actor or game.player\\n\\t\\t-- choose where to put object (default is current actor's inventory)\\n\\t\\tlocal d = Dialog:multiButtonPopup(_t\\\"Place Object\\\", _t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\",\\n\\t\\t\\t{{name=(\\\"Inventory of %s%s\\\"):tformat( actor:getName(), actor.player and _t\\\" #LIGHT_GREEN#(player)#LAST#\\\" or \\\"\\\"), choice=\\\"player\\\", fct=function(sel)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t-- if not obj.quest and not obj.plot then obj.__transmo = true end\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tactor:addObject(actor.INVEN_INVEN, obj)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tgame.zone:addEntity(game.level, obj, \\\"object\\\")\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t_M.findObject(self, obj, actor)\\n\\t\\t\\tend},\\n\\t\\t\\t{name=(\\\"Drop @ (%s, %s)%s\\\"):tformat(actor.x, actor.y, actor.player and _t\\\" #LIGHT_GREEN#(player)#LAST#\\\" or \\\"\\\"), choice=\\\"drop\\\", fct=function(sel)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tgame.zone:addEntity(game.level, obj, \\\"object\\\", actor.x, actor.y)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tgame.log(\\\"#LIGHT_BLUE#Dropped %s at (%d, %d)\\\", obj:getName({do_color=true}), actor.x, actor.y)\\n\\t\\t\\tend},\\n\\t\\t\\t{name=(\\\"NPC Inventory\\\"):tformat(), choice=\\\"npc\\\", fct=function(sel)\\n\\t\\t\\t\\tlocal x, y, act = _M.objectToTarget(self, obj)\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q032\",\"source\":\"Amassed 3000 gold pieces.\",\"target\":\"在“龙之贪婪”成就中积累3000金币。\",\"source_context\":\"\\timage = \\\"object/money_large.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Amassed 1000 gold pieces.]],\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who)\\n\\t\\treturn who.money >= 1000\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"object/money_large.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who)\\n\\t\\treturn who.money >= 3000\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{ id = \\\"DRAGON_GREED\\\",\\n\\tname = \\\"Dragon's Greed\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"object/money_large.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Amassed 8000 gold pieces.]],\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who)\\n\\t\\treturn who.money >= 8000\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q033\",\"source\":\"Became the new master of the arena in 30-wave mode.\",\"target\":\"在30波模式中成为新的竞技场主宰。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Got to wave 20 in the arena.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Arena Battler 50\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Got to wave 50 in the arena.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Almost Master of Arena\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Master of Arena\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Became the new master of the arena in 60-wave mode.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"XXX the Destroyer\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Earned the rank of Destroyer in the arena.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q034\",\"source\":\"I will not let you down!\",\"target\":\"我一定会让你失望的！\",\"source_context\":\"-- MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.  See the\\n-- GNU General Public License for more details.\\n--\\n-- You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License\\n-- along with this program.  If not, see <http://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.\\n--\\n-- Nicolas Casalini \\\"DarkGod\\\"\\n-- darkgod@te4.org\\n\\nnewChat{ id=\\\"welcome\\\",\\n\\ttext = _t[[I do not have time to talk. This ritual is intense, and we are not alone here. Stop them!]],\\n\\tanswers = {\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\"},\\n\\t\\t{_t\\\"[leave]\\\"},\\n\\t}\\n}\\n\\n\\nreturn \\\"welcome\\\"\\n\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q035\",\"source\":\"Got to wave 50 in the arena.\",\"target\":\"竞技场生存至第20轮。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tdesc = _t[[Unlocked Arena mode.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Arena Battler 20\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Got to wave 20 in the arena.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Arena Battler 50\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Almost Master of Arena\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Became the new master of the arena in 30-wave mode.]],\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Master of Arena\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Became the new master of the arena in 60-wave mode.]],\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q036\",\"source\":\"Now, this is impressive!\",\"target\":\"这个发现可真是令人印象深刻！\",\"source_context\":\"\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"You know who's to blame (reprise)\\\", id = \\\"FIRST_BOSS_MYSSIL\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"npc/humanoid_halfling_protector_myssil.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed Myssil, causing her to drop the Rod of Recall.]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", id = \\\"LINANIIL_DEAD\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"npc/humanoid_human_linaniil_supreme_archmage.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed Linaniil, the Supreme Archmage of Angolwen.]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Fear of Fours\\\", id = \\\"SLIME_TUNNEL_BOSSES\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed all four bosses of the Slime Tunnels.]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, target)\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q037\",\"source\":\"Achieved your wild dreams of power and eternal life: you turned into a Lich!\",\"target\":\"成就你的野心并获得永恒的生命，你终于成为了巫妖！\",\"source_context\":\"\\tname = \\\"Cryomancer\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Unlocked Archmage class and did over one million cold damage (with any item/talent/class).]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\",\\n\\tmode = \\\"world\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, dam)\\n\\t\\tself.nb = (self.nb or 0) + dam\\n\\t\\treturn self.nb > 1000000 and profile.mod.allow_build.mage\\n\\tend,\\n\\ttrack = function(self) return tstring{tostring(math.floor(self.nb or 0)),\\\" / 1000000\\\"} end,\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Lichform\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Best album ever!\\\", id = \\\"THE_CURE\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.]],\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", \\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who)\\n\\t\\tself.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\\n\\t\\tif self.nb >= 89 then return true end\\n\\tend,\\n\\ttrack = function(self) return tstring{tostring(self.nb or 0),\\\" / 89\\\"} end,\\n}\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q038\",\"source\":\"Kickin' it old-school\",\"target\":\"现代风格\",\"source_context\":\"\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"I'm a cool hero\\\", id = \\\"NO_DERTH_DEATH\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"npc/humanoid_human_human_farmer.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Saved Derth without a single inhabitant dying.]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", id = \\\"FIRST_BOSS_URKIS\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"npc/humanoid_human_urkis__the_high_tempest.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed Urkis, the Tempest, causing him to drop the Rod of Recall.]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Leave the big boys alone\\\", id = \\\"FIRST_BOSS_MASTER\\\",\\n\\timage = \\\"npc/the_master.png\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed The Master, causing him to drop the Rod of Recall.]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q039\",\"source\":\"Killed a boss while already dead.\",\"target\":\"在已死亡的状态下杀死一个BOSS。\",\"source_context\":\"\\t\\t\\treturn true\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\tend,\\n\\ton_gain = function(_, src, personal)\\n--\\t\\tgame:setAllowedBuild(\\\"construct\\\")\\n--\\t\\tgame:setAllowedBuild(\\\"construct_runic_golem\\\", true)\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Take you with me\\\", id = \\\"BOSS_REVENGE\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n\\tmode = \\\"player\\\",\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, target)\\n\\t\\tlocal p = game.party:findMember{main=true}\\n\\t\\tif target.rank >= 3.5 and p.dead then\\n\\t\\t\\treturn true\\n\\t\\tend\\n\\tend,\\n}\\n\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Look at me, I'm playing a roguelike!\\\", id = \\\"SELF_CENTERED\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\"},{\"neutral_id\":\"Q040\",\"source\":\"Stabilized the Abashed Expanse to maintain it in orbit.\",\"target\":\"控制次元浮岛使其稳定在地面上。\",\"source_context\":\"\\tname = \\\"Paradoxology\\\", id = \\\"PARADOX_FULL\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Both killed your future self and got killed by your future self.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Explorer\\\", id = \\\"EXPLORER\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Used the Sher'Tul fortress exploratory farportal at least 7 times with the same character.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Orbituary\\\", id = \\\"ABASHED_EXPANSE\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Wibbly Wobbly Timey Wimey Stuff\\\", id = \\\"UNHALLOWED_MORASS\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"name\\\",\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Killed the weaver queen and the temporal defiler.]],\\n}\\nnewAchievement{\\n\\tname = \\\"Matrix style!\\\", id = \\\"ABASHED_EXPANSE_NO_BLAST\\\",\\n\\tshow = \\\"full\\\", huge=true,\\n\\tdesc = _t[[Finished the whole Abashed Expanse zone without being hit by a single void blast or manaworm. Dodging's fun!]],\\n\\tcan_gain = function(self, who, zone)\\n\\t\\tif not who:isQuestStatus(\\\"start-archmage\\\", engine.Quest.DONE) then return false end\"}]}"}],"timestamp":1787984617209},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me review each item.\n\nQ021: source \"which you do not understand: ...\" target \"即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解：...\" — source says \"which you do not understand\"; target says \"even if you understand this language, you cannot understand\". That's a contradiction — DIRECTION/CONDITION reversal. FINDING. Target span \"即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解\". Correction: \"你无法理解这种语言：\". Evidence \"which you do not understand\".\n\nQ022: source \"The staff will allow us to drain...\" target \"这根法杖将让我们得以...\" fine. Source context has \"The staff has allowed us...\" but source is \"will allow\". Target matches source. \"You cannot stop us now!\" target \"你现在已经无法阻止我们了！\" fine. Source_context differs but source is the item's source; translation matches source. No finding. Actually the source says \"will allow us\" and target \"将让我们得以\" — fine. No issue.\n\nQ023: source \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\" target \"一副狂乱的眼睛凝视着他\" — \"peer out\" means look out through the slot; target says 凝视着他 (stares at him). Also \"他\" — should be \"你\"? The speaker addresses the player: \"What do you want\". Eyes peer out at the player. Target \"凝视着他\" uses third person \"him\" but should be looking out / at you. Is this a defect? \"peer out\" = 看出来/向外窥视. Target \"凝视着他\" — direction/referent: eyes peer out (from inside), not staring at him specifically... Actually peering out through the slot toward the player implies looking at you. \"他\" vs implied \"你\" — in Chinese translation, using \"他\" for player viewpoint is odd. This is arguably SUBJECT/REFERENT issue: player character should be second person. The rest of the translation uses 你 (\"你想干什么\"). So \"凝视着他\" is inconsistent — eyes peer out, staring at him. Hmm. The source \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\" doesn't specify whom they look at, just \"peer out\" (向外看). Target adds \"凝视着他\" — the \"他\" contradicts second-person narration. I'd call FINDING REFERENT: correction \"*一副狂乱的眼睛向外窥视。*\" Evidence \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\". Verdict: FINDING seems reasonable since \"他\" is third person while game addresses player as 你.\n\nQ024: \"Aeryn, are you well?\" → \"艾琳，你还好么？\" Fine. No issue.\n\nQ025: source \"I have not been able to find all of the orbs of command in my travels; could you have some of your men search for me?\" target \"我没能找到所有的指令水晶球；请问你可以让你们的人来帮我寻找一下吗？\" — fine. \"orbs of command\" translated \"指令水晶球\" — addition of 水晶? \"orbs\" = 球体, adding 水晶 (crystal) is added info but plausible/compatible? Rule 3: 新增但与可见证据相容、且无法由可见证据判错的具体信息，不构成缺陷. Can visible evidence judge \"水晶\" wrong? Source just says \"orbs\". Can't judge wrong. Not a defect. No finding.\n\nQ026: \"Number of items to make\" → \"制作的物品数量\". Fine.\n\nQ027: source \"Excellent. Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared.\" Target: \"很好，几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了。\" Hmm — \"I'll have everything prepared\" future; target \"我肯定把一切都准备好了\" reads as already prepared? Ambiguous. Also \"which the men of Sholtar sealed many years ago\" — \"那是多年前肖尔塔人封印的地方\" fine. \"return with it and your odds of surviving our portal attempt will go up drastically\" — \"请帮我带回来，这能大大提高你通过传送门时存活的几率\" fine. The \"我肯定把一切都准备好了\" — could read \"I'll surely have everything prepared (by then)\". Chinese \"几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了\" — with 了 it implies completion; future perfect, acceptable. Marginal; I might flag UNCERTAIN on VALUE/TIMING? Actually \"Return in a few days\" — target \"几天后你回来\" fine. I'll say no finding, or UNCERTAIN. I think it's acceptable; skip.\n\nQ028: \"you are called to serve\" → \"你效力的时候到了\" fine-ish. \"The nearby unhallowed morass inhabitants are growing restless\" → \"附近不洁沼泽中的居民正在蠢蠢欲动\" fine. \"You must go there and find the source\" → \"你必须去那里，找到这一切的源头\" fine. No finding.\n\nQ029: \"Nothing but hatchlings so far\" → \"到目前为止从未遇上幼龙\" — \"nothing but hatchlings\" means only hatchlings (we've found nothing except hatchlings). Target says \"从未遇上幼龙\" = never encountered hatchlings — opposite! Wait: \"Nothing but hatchlings so far\" = only hatchlings so far. Target: \"从未遇上幼龙\" (never met hatchlings). That's a VALUE/DIRECTION reversal. FINDING. Target span \"到目前为止从未遇上幼龙\". Correction: \"到目前为止只遇到幼龙\". Evidence \"Nothing but hatchlings so far\".\n\nAlso \"she is something special in combat\" — \"她在战斗中确实不同凡响\" fine. \"wyrmic\" translated 龙战士 fine. \"Expedition Captain\" fine. \"Gorran is one of the finest rangers I know\" — \"高岚是我认识的最优秀的巡林客之一\" fine. No other findings.\n\nQ030: \"Report for bad behavior\" → \"举报我的不良行为\" — wait, this is a menu option to report another user's bad behavior. \"我的\" (my) is wrong — the report is about the other user. Source context: user menu for another player (citem.login), option \"Report for bad behavior\" ui=\"report\". Target adds \"我的\" making it report my own behavior. SUBJECT/REFERENT error. FINDING. Correction: \"举报不良行为\" or \"举报该用户的不良行为\". Evidence: \"Report for bad behavior\".\n\nQ031: \"Place the object where?\" → \"将物品丢弃到哪里？\" — source context shows options include inventory and drop; \"place\" ≠ only \"drop\". Target narrows to 丢弃 (drop). But wait — rule: if source_context exists, it's equally valid evidence. Context shows the dialog offers \"Inventory of %s\", \"Drop @\", \"NPC Inventory\". So \"丢弃\" is wrong — should be \"放置\". FINDING. Target span \"将物品丢弃到哪里\". Evidence \"Place the object where?\" Correction: \"将物品放到哪里？\".\n\nQ032: source \"Amassed 3000 gold pieces.\" target \"在\"龙之贪婪\"成就中积累3000金币。\" — the target adds \"在'龙之贪婪'成就中\" (in the Dragon's Greed achievement). Source context shows this desc belongs to \"Treasure Hoarder\" achievement (3000), while Dragon's Greed is 8000. So the addition is contradicted by source context — the achievement is Treasure Hoarder, not Dragon's Greed. FINDING (ADDITION/REFERENT). Target span \"在\"龙之贪婪\"成就中积累3000金币\" — actually span must appear verbatim: \"在\"龙之贪婪\"成就中积累3000金币。\" The quotes are Chinese full-width \"龙之贪婪\". In the target JSON: \"在“龙之贪婪”成就中积累3000金币。\" I must reproduce exactly. Evidence: source_context shows name = \"Treasure Hoarder\" with desc [[SOURCE_MATCH_1]] and can_gain 3000, while DRAGON_GREED desc is \"Amassed 8000 gold pieces.\" Evidence string must appear verbatim in source or source_context. Use \"name = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\"\" — appears in context. Correction: \"积累3000金币。\" Good.\n\nQ033: \"Became the new master of the arena in 30-wave mode.\" → \"在30波模式中成为新的竞技场主宰。\" Fine.\n\nQ034: \"I will not let you down!\" → \"我一定会让你失望的！\" — opposite meaning! FINDING. Correction: \"我不会让你失望的！\" Claim type DIRECTION (negation reversal) or VALUE. I'll use DIRECTION.\n\nQ035: \"Got to wave 50 in the arena.\" → \"竞技场生存至第20轮。\" — 50 vs 20. FINDING VALUE. Correction \"竞技场生存至第50轮。\" Evidence \"Got to wave 50 in the arena.\"\n\nQ036: \"Now, this is impressive!\" — this is an achievement NAME (LINANIIL_DEAD). Target \"这个发现可真是令人印象深刻！\" — adds \"这个发现\" (this discovery). Source doesn't mention discovery. Is that a defect? Achievement name as exclamation. \"Now, this is impressive!\" Target adds discovery — addition of info not in source. Can visible evidence judge it wrong? Source is just an exclamation; \"这个发现\" adds a specific referent. Hmm, achievement is for killing Linaniil... \"发现\" is not supported. But rule 3: new info compatible with visible evidence and can't be judged wrong by visible evidence doesn't constitute defect. Is \"这个发现\" judgeable as wrong? The source is an exclamation without referent; adding \"发现\" introduces an element not present. It's an ADDITION of a specific subject. I could report as FINDING ADDITION or UNCERTAIN. Given it's an achievement name, adding \"这个发现\" changes meaning somewhat. I'd say FINDING ADDITION: correction \"哇，这可真令人印象深刻！\" Evidence \"Now, this is impressive!\". Hmm, but is that objective? The source has no mention of discovery; the translation asserts \"this discovery\" — objectively an added noun. I'll go FINDING. Or UNCERTAIN to be safe. Achievement name for killing a boss — \"发现\" is unrelated; I'll say FINDING with claim ADDITION.\n\nQ037: \"Achieved your wild dreams of power and eternal life: you turned into a Lich!\" → \"成就你的野心并获得永恒的生命，你终于成为了巫妖！\" — \"wild dreams of power\" = 对力量的狂野梦想; target \"成就你的野心\" loses \"power\" but okay-ish. \"eternal life\" 永恒的生命 fine. Omission of \"力量\" — minor. \"wild\" dropped. Is that an objective defect? \"dreams of power and eternal life\" → \"野心\" covers power-ish ambition loosely. Marginal; I'd not report. Actually \"power\" omitted: OMISSION. Hmm. 野心 (ambition) partially captures \"dreams of power\". I think it's acceptable paraphrase. Skip.\n\nQ038: \"Kickin' it old-school\" → \"现代风格\" (modern style) — opposite! Old-school = 复古/老派. FINDING. Correction: \"复古怀旧\" / \"老派风格\". Claim DIRECTION or VALUE. Evidence \"Kickin' it old-school\". Target span \"现代风格\".\n\nQ039: \"Killed a boss while already dead.\" → \"在已死亡的状态下杀死一个BOSS。\" Fine. Context: p.dead — party leader dead while killing boss. Fine.\n\nQ040: \"Stabilized the Abashed Expanse to maintain it in orbit.\" → \"控制次元浮岛使其稳定在地面上。\" — \"maintain it in orbit\" = 保持其在轨道上; target \"稳定在地面上\" (stable on the ground) — contradicts orbit. FINDING. Correction: \"稳定'恍惚穹域'使其维持在轨道上。\" Achievement name \"Orbituary\" supports orbit. Evidence \"Stabilized the Abashed Expanse to maintain it in orbit.\" Target span \"使其稳定在地面上\". Claim VALUE/OTHER. Use VALUE? It's about location/state. STATE maybe. I'll use STATE.\n\nAlso Q040 \"Abashed Expanse\" translated \"次元浮岛\" — proper noun; zone name. Can't judge without knowledge? The name \"Abashed Expanse\" ≠ 次元浮岛 (dimensional floating island). But it's a proper noun translation choice; the context shows zone name \"Abashed Expanse\". 次元浮岛 doesn't correspond literally but is a localization choice for the zone. Can't definitively say wrong. Skip.\n\nQ022 check again: source \"will allow us\" target \"将让我们得以\" ok. Also \"summon Him through!\" target \"召唤他降临\" fine. No finding.\n\nQ027: also \"It opens the ruins of Telmur\" — \"它可以打开泰尔玛废墟\" fine. \"your odds of surviving our portal attempt\" — \"你通过传送门时存活的几率\" — \"our portal attempt\" = 我们尝试开启传送门; target \"你通过传送门时\" implies passing through. Slight shift but compatible. Skip. Actually \"我肯定把一切都准备好了\" vs \"I'll have everything prepared\" — future promise. The 了 + 肯定 reads like \"I'll surely have it all ready (by then)\". Acceptable. Skip.\n\nQ023 second thought: is \"凝视着他\" a FINDING? The narration in game is second person (\"What do you want, @playerdescriptor.race@?\"). The slot opens and eyes peer out — at the player. \"凝视着他\" introduces third-person \"him\" inconsistent with the second-person address. Also \"peer out\" (向外看/窥视) vs \"凝视\" (stare). Objective: \"他\" has no antecedent in second-person dialogue; the source's \"peer out\" doesn't specify object. I'll report FINDING REFERENT with correction \"*一副狂乱的眼睛向外窥视。*\". Evidence \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\".\n\nQ026 fine.\n\nQ029: also \"Expedition Captain\" — target \"探险队队长\" placed before name: \"探险队队长，科纳克人战士瑞丽\" fine. \"cornac fighter\" fine.\n\nQ028: \"you are called to serve\" — \"你效力的时候到了\" fine.\n\nNow assemble JSON with 20 items Q021–Q040 in order, observation field required for each.\n\nObservations: brief neutral description.\n\nQ021: FINDING, CONDITION (reversal) — actually type: \"which you do not understand\" → \"即使你懂得\" reverses condition. claim_type CONDITION. Correction: \"你无法理解这种语言：\".\n\nQ022: no candidates, observation.\n\nQ023: FINDING REFERENT.\n\nQ024: none.\n\nQ025: none.\n\nQ026: none.\n\nQ027: none.\n\nQ028: none.\n\nQ029: FINDING DIRECTION (or VALUE). \"Nothing but hatchlings\" = only hatchlings; target negates. I'll use DIRECTION.\n\nQ030: FINDING SUBJECT (target says \"my\" bad behavior). Claim SUBJECT.\n\nQ031: FINDING ACTION (place→drop only). Or SCOPE. I'll use ACTION.\n\nQ032: FINDING ADDITION (achievement name) — actually wrong referent: attributes to Dragon's Greed instead of Treasure Hoarder. REFERENT. Use REFERENT.\n\nQ033: none.\n\nQ034: FINDING DIRECTION.\n\nQ035: FINDING VALUE.\n\nQ036: FINDING ADDITION (or UNCERTAIN). I'll go FINDING ADDITION. Hmm, let me reconsider: \"Now, this is impressive!\" as achievement name for killing Linaniil. Target \"这个发现可真是令人印象深刻！\" — \"这个发现\" is an added subject. Objective enough. FINDING ADDITION, correction \"这可真是令人印象深刻！\".\n\nQ037: none.\n\nQ038: FINDING DIRECTION/VALUE — \"old-school\" → \"现代风格\" reversal. DIRECTION.\n\nQ039: none.\n\nQ040: FINDING STATE (in orbit vs on ground).\n\nFor Q032 evidence: must be verbatim from source_context. \"name = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\",\" appears. Also \"desc = _t[[Amassed 8000 gold pieces.]]\" appears. I'll use: \"name = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\"\" plus maybe \"desc = _t[[Amassed 8000 gold pieces.]]\" — evidence can be a single string; I'll include one: \"name = \\\"Treasure Hoarder\\\",\" — check verbatim in context: `\\tname = \"Treasure Hoarder\",` yes contains `name = \"Treasure Hoarder\",`. Good.\n\nFor Q021 evidence: \"which you do not understand:\" verbatim in source. Yes.\n\nFor Q031 evidence: \"Place the object where?\" verbatim in source. Yes. Could also cite \"Drop @\" from context. Use source text.\n\nFor Q040 evidence: \"Stabilized the Abashed Expanse to maintain it in orbit.\" verbatim. Yes.\n\nQ036 evidence: \"Now, this is impressive!\" verbatim.\n\nQ023 evidence: \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\" verbatim.\n\nQ029 evidence: \"Nothing but hatchlings so far\" verbatim.\n\nQ030 evidence: \"Report for bad behavior\" verbatim. Could add context that it's a menu for another user, but evidence must be verbatim string. Use source.\n\nQ034 evidence: \"I will not let you down!\" verbatim.\n\nQ035 evidence: \"Got to wave 50 in the arena.\" verbatim.\n\nQ038 evidence: \"Kickin' it old-school\" verbatim.\n\nTarget spans verbatim:\nQ021: \"即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解\"\nQ023: \"一副狂乱的眼睛凝视着他。\"\nQ029: \"到目前为止从未遇上幼龙\"\nQ030: \"举报我的不良行为\"\nQ031: \"将物品丢弃到哪里？\"\nQ032: \"在“龙之贪婪”成就中积累3000金币\"\nQ034: \"我一定会让你失望的！\"\nQ035: \"竞技场生存至第20轮\"\nQ036: \"这个发现可真是令人印象深刻！\"\nQ038: \"现代风格\"\nQ040: \"使其稳定在地面上\"\n\nOutput JSON only.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q021\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"CONDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解\",\n          \"correction\": \"你无法理解这种语言：\",\n          \"evidence\": \"which you do not understand:\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文说“你看不懂这段文字”，译文反转为“即使你懂得这种语言，也无法理解”，条件关系颠倒。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q022\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"译文与 source 中的将来时态和语气一致，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q023\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"一副狂乱的眼睛凝视着他。\",\n          \"correction\": \"*一副狂乱的眼睛向外窥视。*\",\n          \"evidence\": \"a pair of wild eyes peer out\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"源文只说眼睛从门缝向外窥视，且该对话以第二人称称呼玩家（“你想干什么”），译文却使用“凝视着他”，指代对象与叙述视角不符。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q024\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"问候语的译文准确，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q025\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"译文与源文语义一致；“水晶”为可由上下文相容的补充，不构成缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q026\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"数量对话框标题的译文准确，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q027\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"译文的时态与语义与源文相容，未发现可判定的客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q028\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"任务指派文本的译文与源文语义一致，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q029\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n 